flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare user query and account query]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Execute user query]
    D --> E{User row exists?}
    E -- No --> F[Return null]
    E -- Yes --> G[Build Client object from user row]
    G --> H[Execute account query for user]
    H --> I{More account rows?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Create BankAccount and add to client]
    J --> H
    I -- No --> K[Return populated client]
    C --> L[On SQL error print stack trace]
    L --> F
    F --> M[End]
    K --> M
